e branch is merged:\n\n    cd ../turnbridge\n    git worktree remove ../turnbridge-worktrees/<branch-name>\n    git branch -d <branch-name>\n\n`git worktree list` shows what is currently checked out where.\n\n## Two things to know in this repo\n\n**Each worktree needs its own install.** `conversation-ledger` is a `file:`\ndependency resolved relative to the checkout, and `node_modules/` is not shared\nbetween worktrees:\n\n    npm install && npm run build\n\n**The global `turnbridge`/`tb` command is npm-linked to `../turnbridge`**, the\nmain checkout — not to whatever worktree you are working in. So the CLI on your\nPATH runs `../turnbridge/dist`, and a worktree's changes only reach it once\nthey are merged and that checkout is rebuilt. To exercise a worktree's build\ndirectly, run its own `node dist/cli.js` rather than `tb`.\n","filePath":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge-worktrees/README.md","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[],"type":"create","userModified":false},"type":"user","userType":"external","uuid":"da88c19b-4526-4608-bd3b-2fc47ce03288","version":"2.1.228"},"format":"claude-code-jsonl/1"},"recorded_at":"2026-08-12T00:33:20.719Z","schema":"conversation-ledger/v1"}
