{"actor":{"id":"claude-opus-5","type":"agent"},"content":{"blocks":[{"caller":{"type":"direct"},"id":"toolu_012oxuV1gzEef9NGtt8LTT1i","input":{"content":"# turnbridge worktrees\n\nFeature work for `../turnbridge` lives here, one directory per branch, so the\nmain checkout stays on `main` and usable.\n\n    cd ../turnbridge\n    git worktree add ../turnbridge-worktrees/<branch-name> -b <branch-name>\n    cd ../turnbridge-worktrees/<branch-name>\n\nWhen the branch is merged:\n\n    cd ../turnbridge\n    git worktree remove ../turnbridge-worktrees/<branch-name>\n    git branch -d <branch-name>\n\n`git worktree list` shows what is currently checked out where.\n\n## Two things to know in this repo\n\n**Each worktree needs its own install.** `conversation-ledger` is a `file:`\ndependency resolved relative to the checkout, and `node_modules/` is not shared\nbetween worktrees:\n\n    npm install && npm run build\n\n**The global `turnbridge`/`tb` command is npm-linked to `../turnbridge`**, the\nmain checkout — not to whatever worktree you are working in. So the CLI on your\nPATH runs `../turnbridge/dist`, and a worktree's changes only reach it once\nthey are merged and that checkout is rebuilt. To exercise a worktree's build\ndirectly, run its own `node dist/cli.js` rather than `tb`.\n","file_path":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge-worktrees/README.md"},"name":"Write","type":"tool_use"}],"role":"assistant"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","head":"defab1d48ffb334ef077b543c74110f5a05efd71","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:4fc5e727-a1d5-4399-a448-9d24a0ce9c15","seq":1113},"id":"ev1-276fc4ba42aeb18cb9f398fb5d9355857df7dc9088b5fc2e5465f49ac828a470","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-08-12T00:32:37.039Z","producer":{"model":"claude-opus-5","session_id":"4fc5e727-a1d5-4399-a448-9d24a0ce9c15","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.228","tool":"cled